    "attacksNotes": "<p>Gust [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 6 + Melee Combat 1), Reach: 5 ft.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 2 damage (1 + 1 Str); target loses any unsecured held item lighter than 1 lb.</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 2 damage, DR halved (round up); target's next ranged attack adds 1 to one die of their choice from wind interference.</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Wind Whisper: The Whispervane carries a spoken message of up to 25 words to any creature within 300 feet it can perceive. Message delivered as a whisper only the target can hear. Transit time is 1 round. It executes this without fail. Near-Invisible: Perception checks to spot the Whispervane by sight alone add 2 to both dice except in strong light or dusty conditions.</p>",
